    "UIName": "Summoner [Thor]",
    "Id": "chassisdef_summoner_D",
    "Name": "Summoner -- Thor",
    "Details": "The Summoner is a highly mobile heavy OmniMech that is commonly used by Clan Jade Falcon in a wide variety of roles. The Summoner's balanced mix of speed, mobility, armor, and firepower make it a highly effective and reliable OmniMech. The Summoner is powered by a lightweight 350 XL engine. The mobility is enhanced with five jump jets. The Summoner has fourteen double heat sinks and to protect it from damage, it carries nine and a half tons of Ferro-Fibrous armor. A multi-role configuration of the Summoner, the D configuration is armed with a pair of ER Large Lasers for long range combat. These are backed up by a pair of ER Medium Lasers for short range combat. All of these lasers are linked to an advanced Targeting Computer making the 'Mech highly accurate. For close combat, the 'Mech has a pair of Machine Guns. A pair of Anti-Missile Systems give the 'Mech protection from missile carrying 'Mechs and vehicles.",
    "Icon": "Thor"
  },
